s=3D"hljs-number">5</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">7</span>, <span cla=
ss=3D"hljs-number">8</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">9</span>], target =
=3D <span class=3D"hljs-number">4</span>
Output: <span class=3D"hljs-number">2</span>
</code></pre><h4 id=3D"example-2">Example 2:</h4><pre><code class=3D"hljs l=
anguage-python">Input: nums =3D [<span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>, <spa=
n class=3D"hljs-number">2</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">4</span>, <sp=
