pan class=3D"hljs-number">8</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">9</span>], =
target =3D <span class=3D"hljs-number">6</span>
Output: <span class=3D"hljs-number">4</span>
</code></pre><p>Explanation: 6 would be inserted at index 4 to be positione=
d between 5 and 7: <code>[1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]</code>.</p></div>
